              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Aso, naeriŋar aisumunet naka alomar aibworareteke esalit, kakuriakaros, kinyek idio kayesi atakanun mam edolokinit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naarai oni da kilimonokinitai Akiro Nukajokak kwape kakesi; konye akirot nakiirarete mam abu koinu kes ajokis, naarai mam aponi kimorikikinai kotoma aiyuun nepepe kaŋul luapotu kiirasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
